<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Kosmos - Plan trips, itineraries, bookings and budgets in one place</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Kosmos keeps your itinerary, bookings, expenses and packing list together. Forward a confirmation email and the details are filled in for you.">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('../partials/public_header') %>

    <header class="bg-dark text-light text-center py-5">
        <div class="container py-4">
            <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold">Your whole trip, in one place</h1>
            <p class="lead mx-auto" style="max-width: 640px;">
                Kosmos keeps your itinerary, bookings, expenses and packing list together, so you stop
                digging through email and spreadsheets the night before you leave.
            </p>
            <a href="/auth/signup" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg me-2">Create a free account</a>
            <a href="/auth/login" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg">Log in</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="container my-5">
        <div class="row g-4">
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card h-100 p-3">
                    <h5>Forward a confirmation, skip the typing</h5>
                    <p class="mb-0">Forward a hotel, flight or rental confirmation to your personal Kosmos address, or upload the PDF.
                        Kosmos reads it and drafts the booking, itinerary items and expenses for you to review before anything is saved.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card h-100 p-3">
                    <h5>Day-by-day itinerary</h5>
                    <p class="mb-0">Plan each day with times, locations and map links, see the bookings that cover that date,
                        and estimate driving time between stops.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card h-100 p-3">
                    <h5>Expenses that add up</h5>
                    <p class="mb-0">Log costs by category and date and see where the money is going, per trip.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card h-100 p-3">
                    <h5>Packing lists</h5>
                    <p class="mb-0">Track what is packed with a progress bar. New to packing for a trip? Start with our
                        <a href="/guides/packing-list">travel packing checklist</a>.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card h-100 p-3">
                    <h5>Plan together</h5>
                    <p class="mb-0">Share a trip with travel companions as a viewer or an editor, so everyone sees the same plan.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card h-100 p-3">
                    <h5>Always know what is next</h5>
                    <p class="mb-0">Your dashboard separates past, upcoming and in-progress trips and shows how many days until you go.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center mt-5">
            <h3>Ready to plan your next trip?</h3>
            <a href="/auth/signup" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg mt-2">Get started</a>
        </div>
    </main>

    <%- include('../partials/public_footer') %>
</body>
</html>
